OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial lit up for first time in
OL,4,Aa century as part of Remembrance
OL,5,Atributes
OL,6,
OL,7,FA neglected war memorial has been
OL,8,Fpainstakingly restored by volunteers
OL,9,Fand lit up for the first time in its
OL,10,F104-year history ahead of Remembrance
OL,11,FDay.
OL,13,FThe Grade II* listed Hoylake and West
OL,14,FKirby monument has been transformed
OL,15,Fthanks to 14 years of renovations by
OL,16,Fthe Friends of Grange Hill and Wirral
OL,17,FBorough Council.
OL,19,FThe spectacle is just one of a range of
OL,20,Fcolourful tributes and events ahead of
OL,21,FRemembrance Sunday across north-west
OL,22,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
